  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Audit of internal control environment,            ANRE and MEPIU - Audit of internal control environment,</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Revision intern styrning &amp; kontroll               ANRE och MEPIU</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Audit of internal control environment                                  1. Moldova Energy Project Implementation Unit (MEPIU). MEPIU         currently handles Sida funds. The audit aims to assess risk           alterations due to lack of funding to MEPIU&apos;s running budget.          2. ANRE, Moldova&apos;s energy regulator. The audit is part of assessment in preparation of long term technical assistance.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Revision av intern kontollmijl&#xf6; av 1. Moldova Energy Project          Implementation Unit som idag hanterar Sidamedel. Syftet &#xe4;r att bed&#xf6;ma risker maa f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar i finansieringen av MEPIUs budget.             2. Moldaviens energireglermyndighet, ANRE. Revionen i syfte att      bed&#xf6;ma m&#xf6;jligheter att hantera Sidamedel f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;rre                   kapacitetsf&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkande insats.</narrative>
  </description>
